        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-blue" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 16V4"/><path d="M7 9l5-5 5 5"/><path d="M4 16v3a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-3"/></svg>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 font-semibold text-base">Photo yahan upload karein</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted">Aapki photo automatic cut aur fit ho jaye gi</p>
